NCT05337267.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Males aged 18 to 45 (including both ends);
2. Body Mass Index (BMI) is 19.0\~28.0 kg/m2 (including both ends), and body weight is 62.0\~73.0kg (including both ends);
3. The investigator is assessed as a healthy male subject based on a complete medical history, including physical examination, vital signs, 12-lead electrocardiogram and laboratory tests;
